'''Tapu Bulu''' (Japanese: '''カプ・ブルル''' ''Kapu-Bulul'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

